    "title": "‘Invincible’ Season 4 Episode 7 – release date, schedule, how to watch",
    "text": "The grand finale of \"Invincible\" Season 4 is approaching, but first, the penultimate episode will air next on Prime Video on April 15 at the usual time of 12 a.m. PT/3 a.m. ET.Mark has been fighting to protect his home and loved ones, and the final two episodes are set to wrap this season's events up neatly, but will it include a happy ending? Walton Goggins (Cecil Stedman) and Chris Diamantopoulos (Donald Ferguson) in \"Invincible\" Season 4. (Prime Video) | Courtesy of Prime'Invincible' Season 4 Episode 7 Release Date\"Invincible\" Season 4 Episode 7 will be available to stream on Prime Video on April 15, 2026.New episodes of \"Invincible\" Season 4 premiere on Prime Video each Wednesday through April 22, 2026.'Invincible' Season 4 Episode 7 – How to Watch\"Invincible\" Season 4 Episode 7 lands at 12 a.m. PT/3 a.m. ET on Prime Video on April 15, 2026.A Prime Video subscription is required to watch \"Invincible\" Season 4. Prime Video costs $14.99 per month or $139 annually when included with an Amazon Prime membership, or you can subscribe to the streaming service alone for $8.99 per month.What Time Does 'Invincible' Season 4 Episode 7 Come Out?\"Invincible\" Season 4 Episode 7 will be available on Prime Video from 12 a.m. PT/3 a.m. ET.With the early streaming release in the US, the debut time in other time zones will differ. Here is when \"Invincible\" Season 4 will air in different time zones:April 15BRT: 4:00 amBST: 8:00 amCEST: 9:00 amIST: 12:30 pmJST: 4:00 pmAET: 5:00 pmNZDT: 7:00 pmWill All Episodes of 'Invincible' Season 4 Land at Once?No. Season 4 of \"Invincible\" will launch with three episodes on March 18, followed by new episodes weekly through April 22.Will There Be More Than One Episode of 'Invincible' Season 4 This Week?No. New episodes will now debut on Prime Video every week, following the three-episode Season 4 premiere.'Invincible' Season 4 Release ScheduleEpisode 1: March 18Episode 2: March 18Episode 3: March 18Episode 4: March 25Episode 5: April 1Episode 6: April 8Episode 7: April 15Episode 8: April 22'Invincible' Season 4 Episode 7 RuntimeThere is no confirmed runtime for \"Invincible\" Season 4 Episode 7 yet. Previous episodes in this season have ranged from 49 to 53 minutes in length.What Will Happen in 'Invincible' Season 4 Episode 7?The plot details for Episode 7 of \"Invincible\" Season 4 are currently under wraps.Previous episode synopses read:Episode 1: Mark battles enemies new and old in his fight to keep Earth safe.Episode 2: Loyalties are challenged when an old enemy is revealed.Episode 3: Consequences weigh on Mark. Oliver takes on a new job.Episode 4: A family confronts a fire danger. A cave exploration uncovers an unexpectedly shallow \"bottomless\" pit. Art makes something fresh for Mark. Eve handles surprise guests. Mark gains wisdom from an unusual mentor.Episode 5: Mark embarks on a new and dangerous mission, throwing Debbie into a tailspin and Eve into uncertainty.(as per IMDb)The Season 4 synopsis, as per Prime Video, reads, \"While the world recovers from catastrophe, a changed Mark fights to protect his home and the people he loves, setting him on a collision course with a threat that could alter the fate of humanity forever.\"",
